BEGIN_DESC
AtmoFX alpha, level 1 (stock D3D9 client). The probe hangs 180 000 km above Jupiter, just past the terminator, looking straight down: the night side is under it, the day side beyond the terminator. Storm cells flash on the night side.
Keys: J - lightning on/off. Ctrl+arrows / right mouse button - look around. Numpad8/2 with Shift - change altitude.
END_DESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 60970.5
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship Probe
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET Probe
  MODE Cockpit
  FOV 60.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_HUD
  TYPE Surface
END_HUD

BEGIN_SHIPS
Probe:AtmoProbe
  STATUS Landed Jupiter
  POS 0.0000000 -15.0000000
  HEADING 0.00
  ALTKM 180000
  SUNELEV -15
END
END_SHIPS
